{"title": "Magic Armour Trader Table", "pageid": 14895, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magic_Armour_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables", "Leveled drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Magic Armour Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>EquipmentTrader_BodyArmor_Magic</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_BodyArmor_Magic+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_BodyArmor_Magic+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing enchanted <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">armour</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Full_drop_table\">Full drop table</span></h3>\n<p><i>The following is the contents of the treasure table.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table\" title=\"Light Magic Armour Trader Table\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table\" title=\"Light Magic Armour Trader Table\">Light Magic Armour Trader Table</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table\" title=\"Medium Magic Armour Trader Table\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table\" title=\"Medium Magic Armour Trader Table\">Medium Magic Armour Trader Table</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table\" title=\"Heavy Magic Armour Trader Table\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table\" title=\"Heavy Magic Armour Trader Table\">Heavy Magic Armour Trader Table</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table_summary\">Drop table summary</span></h3>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Magic Armour Trader Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p><p><i>Includes all eligible items from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Magic Armour Trader Table</a>. Below is a list of those items; the actual stock will depend on your level.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Light armour<sup id=\"cite_ref-light_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-light-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Leather Armour +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.