title=\"Forge of the Nine\">Forge of the Nine</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gloomy_Fentonson\" title=\"Gloomy Fentonson\">Gloomy Fentonson</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Armoury\" title=\"Stormshore Armoury\">Stormshore Armoury</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\">Exxvikyap</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">Rivington General</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Entharl_Danthelon\" title=\"Entharl Danthelon\">Entharl Danthelon</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Danthelon%27s_Dancing_Axe\" title=\"Danthelon's Dancing Axe\">Danthelon's Dancing Axe</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Arkleia_Oloril\" title=\"Arkleia Oloril\">Arkleia Oloril</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-light-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-light_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">From the <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table\" title=\"Light Magic Armour Trader Table\">Light Magic Armour Trader Table</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-medium-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-medium_2-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">From the <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table\" title=\"Medium Magic Armour Trader Table\">Medium Magic Armour Trader Table</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-heavy-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-heavy_3-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">From the <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table\" title=\"Heavy Magic Armour Trader Table\">Heavy Magic Armour Trader Table</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP l